OL,3,GNEWSATwo-day sea search for missing
OL,4,Ateen on holiday is called off
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Maritime and Coastguard Agency told
OL,7,Fthe BBC that there were currently no
OL,8,Fplans to resume the search.
